# proto-file: wfa/measurement/api/v2alpha/population_spec.proto
# proto-message: PopulationSpec

# Synthetic 360M population covering all 50 states, three age groups and both genders.
# VIDs 1..10610000 cycle through 10000-VID stripes across CA, NY, TX, FL and IL.
# The remaining VIDs are distributed evenly across all 300 demographic cohorts.

